fault=True) if true a tool will be offered to obtain global instruction and tools will instruct the agent to use it, as agents do not always have the MCP server glboal instructions incldued in their system prompt.\r\n\r\nHowever, I could not find any such functionality in the whole codebase. Maybe it was forgotten? If I just missed, it somehow, please let me know and close this PR.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes this by checking the DJANGO_MCP_GET_SERVER_INSTRUCTIONS_TOOL variable and if it is set to True (which it is by default) it will create a \"get_server_instructions\" tool which returns the server instructions, just like the README indicates.\r\n\r\nAs a result the agents will check this tool before doing anything:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"418\" height=\"38\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf979af7-4373-4de5-930b-d4631a776b80\" />\r\n\r\nPS. I could not find any contribution guidelines in this project, let me know if I missed something and I'll adapt.\r\n\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-08-13T12:54:42Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T07:58:14Z","closed_at":"2025-10-09T07:55:23Z","merged_at":"2025-10-09T07:55:23Z","merge_commit_sha":"1fa860e869afb6d12a08768b1890d3662403338e","assignee":{"login":"omarbenhamid","id":1033063,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzMwNjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1033063?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid","html_url":"https://github.com/omarbenhamid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.githu